#: ../../../changelog.rst:3177 ../../../changelog.rst:3220
msgid "**Build and packaging**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:172
msgid ""
":gh:`2788`, :label:`breaking`: git tags renamed from ``release-X.Y.Z`` to "
"``vX.Y.Z`` (old tags are kept). See :ref:`migration guide <migration-8.0-git-"
"tags>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:175
msgid ""
":gh:`2914`, [macOS], :label:`breaking`: Intel wheels now require macOS 10.15 "
"or higher, up from 10.9. ``arm64`` wheels are unaffected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:177
msgid ""
":gh:`2915`, :label:`breaking`: stop publishing wheels for free-threaded "
"CPython 3.13 (``cp313t``), which was experimental. Only ``cp314t`` wheels "
"are published."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:180
msgid ":gh:`2976`, [Linux]: publish ppc64le and s390x wheels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:181
msgid ""
":gh:`2576`: the C extension modules now use PEP 489 multi-phase "
"initialization."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:183
msgid ":gh:`2844`: removed docs/ from the tarball (from 586K to 396K)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:184
msgid ""
":gh:`2883`: the platform-specific C extension modules are now built as a "
"single private ``_psutil`` module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:186
msgid ""
":gh:`2909`: ``setup.py`` no longer uses ``distutils`` (removed in Python "
"3.12)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:188
msgid ""
":gh:`2925`: the C sources are now compiled in parallel, making builds **2x "
"to 3.6x faster**. This mostly helps platforms with no wheels (\\*BSD, "
"Solaris, AIX). Use :envvar:`PSUTIL_BUILD_JOBS` to cap the number of jobs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:192 ../../../changelog.rst:1034
#: ../../../changelog.rst:1358 ../../../changelog.rst:1745
#: ../../../changelog.rst:2377 ../../../changelog.rst:2735
msgid "**Documentation**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:194
msgid ""
":gh:`2757`, :gh:`2760`: split docs from a single HTML file into multiple new "
"sections: :doc:`/about <about>`, :doc:`/adoption <adoption>` "
"(:gh:`2763`), :doc:`/alternatives <alternatives>` (:gh:`2775`), :doc:`/api-"
"overview <api-overview>`, :doc:`/credits <credits>` (:gh:`2764`), :doc:`/faq "
"<faq>` (:gh:`2769`), :doc:`/funding <funding>` (:gh:`2797`), :ref:`/genindex "
"<genindex>` (:gh:`2808`), :doc:`/glossary <glossary>` (:gh:`2774`), :doc:`/"
"install <install>`, :doc:`/migration <migration>` (:gh:`2771`), :doc:`/"
"performance <performance>` (:gh:`2787`), :doc:`/platform <platform>`, :doc:`/"
"recipes <recipes>` (:gh:`2761`), :doc:`/shell-equivalents <shell-"
"equivalents>` (:gh:`2768`), :doc:`/stdlib-equivalents <stdlib-equivalents>` "
"(:gh:`2781`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:206
msgid ""
"Blog: new blog at :doc:`/blog <blog>` (:gh:`2825`), with 20 posts imported "
"from https://gmpy.dev, with comments via `giscus <https://giscus.app/>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:209
msgid ""
"Theming: renewed theme with a top bar (:gh:`2819`), dark theme (:gh:`2803`, "
"``Shift+D``), Monokai code snippets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:212
msgid ""
"Usability: right TOC sidebar (:gh:`2828`), COPY button on code snippets "
"(:gh:`2761`), \"copy page\" button copying the page's RsT source "
"(:gh:`2981`), \"back to top\" button. Identifiers in code blocks (e.g. "
"``psutil.Process()``, ``p.cpu_percent()``) are clickable (:gh:`2826`). "
"Improved prose / clarity (:gh:`2745`, :gh:`2801`). Keyboard shortcuts "
"(:gh:`2820`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:218
msgid "Go to API definition by pressing ``@`` (:gh:`2995`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:220
msgid ""
"Testing: ``rstcheck`` was replaced by ``sphinx-lint`` + detect dead ref "
"links (:gh:`2767`). Python code snippets are syntax-checked at build time "
"(:gh:`2761`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:224
msgid ""
"Hosting: moved from Read the Docs to GitHub Pages at https://psutil.io, with "
"no ``/en`` URL prefix (:gh:`2790`). Deployed on every push to ``master`` "
"(:gh:`2739`). Past releases are served too, e.g. https://psutil.io/7.2/ "
"(:gh:`2980`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:229
msgid ""
"Misc: doc is built in CI (fails on error), ``.rst`` files are wrapped via "
"https://github.com/giampaolo/rstwrap (:gh:`2823`), added ``/sitemap.xml``. "
"New 404 page (:gh:`2829`)."
msgstr ""

