#: ../../../changelog.rst:509
msgid ""
":gh:`2707`, [macOS], :label:`memleak`: fix potential memory leaks in error "
"paths of :meth:`Process.memory_full_info` and :meth:`Process.threads`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:511
msgid ""
