msgid "7.2.1 — 2025-12-29"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:520
msgid ""
":gh:`2699`, [FreeBSD], [NetBSD]: :func:`heap_info` does not detect small "
"allocations (<= 1K). In order to fix that, we now flush internal jemalloc "
"cache before fetching the metrics."
msgstr ""

