msgid "7.2.0 — 2025-12-23"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:529
msgid ""
":gh:`1275`: new :func:`heap_info` and :func:`heap_trim` functions, providing "
"direct access to the platform's native C :term:`heap` allocator (glibc, "
